{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-1c1c617e90a08c56f2fdf457c4159396b84f2bafea31835c","family_id":"KR:002619","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"288439","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=288439","source_sha256":"6fddccc8dd40d065ba4af293d38ee89d2ecaf5b6b4ebb45961fc19ab8c83311e","body_sha256":"3a89782e0d8a7dd64ebfd85479af2581081e1347ff19034ceeb07825522b9cb0","article_count":0,"full_text":"ADDENDA (Organization of the Ministry of Strategy and Finance and Its Affiliated Agencies) <Presidential Decree No. 20720, Feb. 29, 2008>\nArticle 1 (Enforcement date)\nThis Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation; provided, of the Presidential Decrees amended pursuant to Article 8 of the Addenda, amendments of the Presidential Decrees which were promulgated before this Decree enters into force, but the dates on which they are to enter into force have yet to arrive, shall enter into force on the respective dates on which the relevant Presidential Decrees enter into force.\nArticles 2 through 7 Omitted.\nArticle 8 (Amendment of other statutes)\n(1) through (9) Omitted.\n(10) The Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act is partially amended as follows:\nIn the proviso to Article 3 subparagraph 1 (c), \"Minister of Commerce, Industry and Energy\" is replaced by \"Minister of Knowledge Economy\".\nIn the main text of the portion of Article 24 (1) other than its subparagraphs, \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Finance and Economy\" is replaced by \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Strategy and Finance\"; in paragraph (2) 2 of that Article, each occurrence of \"Minister of Commerce, Industry and Energy\" is replaced by \"Minister of Knowledge Economy\"; and in the former part of paragraph (4) of that Article, \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Finance and Economy\" is replaced by \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Strategy and Finance\".\nIn Article 25 (1), (3) and (4), each occurrence of \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Finance and Economy\" is replaced by \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Strategy and Finance\".\n(11) through (68) Omitted.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\dba82d66aa1d22d6b69590f4e7bd16b830d28eb146ec71365c0d4334cfbfbe7b.ascii.json","sha256":"dba82d66aa1d22d6b69590f4e7bd16b830d28eb146ec71365c0d4334cfbfbe7b"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"cf19e77b37845b4e392b289b786f431e8e8381a09b50cde4fbe248198a95e6de","unit_key":"addenda-14078-19931231"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"22d6bff0ac4dc62bebb8e77c1770bb29c1c10d11b3f9444c4f89002eaca4eb3b","unit_key":"addenda-14438-19941223"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"2b35feb4c1ed36ceeeadf274d6f52c2280c45ec14b01a1c90f4ef330a3d28781","unit_key":"addenda-15970-19981231"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"71296299738d57cb73bdd7d93eed97381847714de29e7088b53dfa49786f40cf","unit_key":"addenda-17319-20010730"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"e9f82a6e0fa95063830cd2194bca86b8d5c0bcdbec4ec513a406919974e49773","unit_key":"addenda-17644-20020629"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"41d8ad8f6ad045841010ed265b42f2f8a708ea9729256f68528af369587fc211","unit_key":"addenda-18312-20040317"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"c43954c3038d1187ffaa595b48866efd6091227ff2ece953f3fd53e3f59b9741","unit_key":"addenda-18473-20