storical organization title, all specified minister/ordinance replacements and narrower source omission ranges.","target_end":619,"target_start":618},{"new_text":"\nArticle 8 (Amendment of other statutes)\n(1) through (9) Omitted.\n(10) The Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act is partially amended as follows:\nIn the proviso to Article 3 subparagraph 1 (c), \"Minister of Commerce, Industry and Energy\" is replaced by \"Minister of Knowledge Economy\".\nIn the main text of the portion of Article 24 (1) other than its subparagraphs, \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Finance and Economy\" is replaced by \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Strategy and Finance\"; in paragraph (2) 2 of that Article, each occurrence of \"Minister of Commerce, Industry and Energy\" is replaced by \"Minister of Knowledge Economy\"; and in the former part of paragraph (4) of that Article, \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Finance and Economy\" is replaced by \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Strategy and Finance\".\nIn Article 25 (1), (3) and (4), each occurrence of \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Finance and Economy\" is replaced by \"Ordinance of the Ministry of Strategy and Finance\".\n(11) through (68) Omitted.","old_text":"","operation":"insert","original_end":64815,"original_start":64815,"reason":"Restore historical organization title, all specified minister/ordinance replacements and narrower source omission ranges.","target_end":1660,"target_start":628}],"evidence_file":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\english_reuse_analysis_v1\\preserved_db_texts\\kr-002619-288439-en.txt","evidence_file_sha256":"a9b0bfc70a27552562e7968a943b25456511d98d46a8f21ab5ec28a20ca464f2","reused_spans":[{"end":64805,"start":64277,"target_end":618,"target_start":90,"text_sha256":"28ba52d69861bafbedef5c4ed0094ccd34943d5b1a6901b43d36de48c480c382"}],"scope_plan_file":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\